   "cat": "verb",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "Llevar works for clothes you have on and for what you carry: «Llevo una camisa blanca».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "la camisa",
   "significado": "the shirt",
   "pron": "la ka-MI-sa",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "f",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is feminine, so the colour is too: «la camisa blanca», «una camisa negra».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "los pantalones",
   "significado": "the trousers",
